WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:20.437
Capsule toys can read the future,
give good luck, and be a protective charm.

00:00:21.438 --> 00:00:24.566
"They can read the future, give good luck,
and be a protective charm."

00:00:25.233 --> 00:00:27.068
Right, you virgin.

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:40.790
It was dusk last time too.

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:49.424
I honestly don't understand
the burdens you have.

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:55.722
But...

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:59.392
you're not the only one suffering.

00:01:00.935 --> 00:01:03.897
Your accent is so bad
that I don't understand you.

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:07.067
What is this?

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:10.236
It's Akechi Mitsuhide.

00:01:11.488 --> 00:01:12.572
What did he do?

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:16.326
Let's see. Japanese people
treated him like a bad guy.

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:20.246
He's kind of like Brutus,
who betrayed Caesar.

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:22.332
Why did he betray him?

00:01:22.999 --> 00:01:23.833
He probably

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:26.753
had his own principles.

